{
  "project_id": 20,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 7994,
  "title": "Ancient wonders captured in 3D",
  "author": "Ben Kacyra",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/ben_kacyra_ancient_wonders_captured_in_3d",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T11:27:01.767478Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T11:27:01.767478Z",
  "lead_time": 58.788,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "I'd like to start with a short story.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B38A4B9911",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 106,
        "endOffset": 136,
        "text": "ruins of an ancient metropolis",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6DD1E34101",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 41,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "huge winged bulls",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C97AA403F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "And the dad used to use those bulls to tell the boy stories about that civilization and their work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D3FBEB61E8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 164,
        "text": "Let's fast-forward to the San Francisco Bay Area many decades later, where I started a technology company that brought the world its first 3D laser scanning system.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "11DA1AE5EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "Let me show you how it works.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "685BC1C710",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "Female Voice: Long range laser scanning by sending out a pulse that's a laser beam of light.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F53291AA3C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "The system measures the beam's time of flight, recording the time it takes for the light to hit a surface and make its return.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0F4836D826",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "With two mirrors, the scanner calculates the beam's horizontal and vertical angles, giving accurate x, y, and z coordinates.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A19114F3D4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "The point is then recorded into a 3D visualization program.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B2EE02427D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "All of this happens in seconds.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F57A343FE3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "Ben Kacyra: You can see here, these systems are extremely fast.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "10DC70C65D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 47,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "very high accuracy and very high resolution",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "476E9F6327",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "A surveyor with traditional survey tools would be hard-pressed to produce maybe 500 points in a whole day.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1FF8155D7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "These babies would be producing something like ten thousand points a second.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D95D9790F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "paradigm shift",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "30D889595D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "as you can imagine",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3B83C5DCF9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 210,
        "text": "Approximately ten years ago, my wife and I started a foundation to do good, and right about that time, the magnificent Bamiyan Buddhas, hundred and eighty foot tall in Afghanistan, were blown up by the Taliban.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4EA250882D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "They were gone in an instant.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3F9E6749C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "And unfortunately, there was no detailed documentation of these Buddhas.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B1AED5B0C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 176,
        "text": "This clearly devastated me, and I couldn’t help but wonder about the fate of my old friends, the winged bulls, and the fate of the many, many heritage sites all over the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7DECA3BCD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 155,
        "text": "Both my wife and I were so touched by this that we decided to expand the mission of our foundation to include digital heritage preservation of world sites.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ABEC0B1BC2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "We called the project CyArk, which stands for Cyber Archive.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8BA5B0FEED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "To date, with the help of a global network of partners, we’ve completed close to fifty projects.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5BCB6097D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "Let me show you some of them: Chichen Itza, Rapa Nui -- and what you're seeing here are the cloud of points -- Babylon, Rosslyn Chapel, Pompeii, and our latest project, Mt.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2294DDF79",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Let me show you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2796E0DC10",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Rushmore, which happened to be one of our most challenging projects.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17C4060345",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "As you see here, we had to develop a special rig to bring the scanner up close and personal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EE582E8A42",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 70,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "up close and personal",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CB2EF96FC6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "The results of our work in the field are used to produce media and deliverables to be used by conservators and researchers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CDAD158B9D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "We also produce media for dissemination to the public -- free through the CyArk website.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBB000DFA6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "These would be used for education, cultural tourism, etc.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22B3DE3BA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 205,
        "text": "What you're looking at in here is a 3D viewer that we developed that would allow the display and manipulation of [the] cloud of points in real time, cutting sections through them and extracting dimensions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B1C6EB2BA0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "What you're looking at",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F6CCB22B0C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "This happens to be the cloud of points for Tikal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0EAF3A8F4C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "In here you see a traditional 2D architectural engineering drawing",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0F03ED5924",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 67,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "that's used for preservation, and of course we tell the stories through fly-throughs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0790707B6E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 156,
        "text": "And here, this is a fly-through the cloud of points of Tikal, and here you see it rendered and photo-textured with the photography that we take of the site.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6F6F72E809",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "And so this is not a video.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "09B52792ED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "This is actual 3D points with two to three millimeter accuracy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2910AA341",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "And of course the data can be used to develop 3D models that are very accurate and very detailed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A2073E1519",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "And here you're looking at a model that's extracted from the cloud of points for Stirling Castle.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F18ED6414",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "It's used for studies, for visualization, as well as for education.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8A343118F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "And finally, we produce mobile apps that include narrated virtual tools.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D22D9F68BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "The more I got involved in the heritage field, the more it became clear to me",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1F6505F1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 78,
        "endOffset": 167,
        "text": "that we are losing the sites and the stories faster than we can physically preserve them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3F2DEA5E94",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Of course, earthquakes and all the natural phenomena -- floods, tornadoes, etc. -- take their toll.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "065F189675",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 161,
        "text": "However, what occurred to me was human-caused destruction, which was not only causing a significant portion of the destruction, but actually it was accelerating.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FB5BB4C2F2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "This includes arson, urban sprawl, acid rain, not to mention terrorism and wars.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B451E07F1B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "It was getting more and more apparent that we're fighting a losing battle.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ED8A015AC0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "We're losing our sites and the stories",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FCD6191C01",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 38,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": ", and basically we're losing a piece -- and a significant piece -- of our collective memory.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F9A46618BB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "Imagine us as a human race",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D82D8D5AC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "Imagine us as a human race not knowing where we came from.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "003519C12C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 185,
        "endOffset": 209,
        "text": "digital preservation war",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "000C8EF76A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 210,
        "text": "Luckily, in the last two or three decades, digital technologies have been developing that have helped us to develop tools that we've brought to bear in the digital preservation, in our digital preservation war.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0C52EF523E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 176,
        "text": "This includes, for example, the 3D laser scanning systems, ever more powerful personal computers, 3D graphics, high-definition digital photography, not to mention the Internet.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B147899483",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 129,
        "endOffset": 148,
        "text": "accelerate our work",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5FCA05132",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "Because of this accelerated pace of destruction, it became clear to us that we needed to challenge ourselves and our partners to accelerate our work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "507E7CF9E2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 133,
        "text": "And we created a project we call the CyArk 500 Challenge -- and that is to digitally preserve 500 World Heritage Sites in five years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EA3698BCAF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 191,
        "text": "We do have the technology that's scaleable, and our network of global partners has been expanding and can be expanded at a rapid rate, so we're comfortable that this task can be accomplished.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1458BC395D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "the first 500",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0419E63AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "However, to me, the 500 is really just the first 500.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "983F369130",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 320,
        "text": "In order to sustain our work into the future, we use technology centers where we partner with local universities and colleges to take the technology to them, whereby they then can help us with digital preservation of their heritage sites, and at the same time, it gives them the technology to benefit from in the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3ECF7276D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Let me close with another short story.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "02C5008790",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "Two years ago, we were approached by a partner of ours to digitally preserve an important heritage site, a UNESCO heritage site in Uganda, the Royal Kasubi Tombs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "62E406A515",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "The work was done successfully in the field, and the data was archived and publicly disseminated through the CyArk website.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14242388AB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Last March, we received very sad news.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D4B5F414C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "The Royal Tombs had been destroyed by suspected arson.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3C4349BB28",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "A few days later, we received a call: \"Is the data available and can it be used for reconstruction?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A4D9FE1351",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "Our answer, of course, was yes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D31A195CA1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Let me leave you with a final thought.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A54A0895E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "Our heritage is much more than our collective memory -- it's our collective treasure.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D16187BE4C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "our children, our grandchildren and the generations we will never meet",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF280267C6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "560AA21052",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "(Applause) Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "736DF03B87",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "560D497173",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BF3436B69",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 56,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "to you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5441419428",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 63,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "the power of this technology",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6235E5D8A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "The two wizards that I have that are behind the curtain",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C3379B1994",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 43,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "you can fly through the cloud of points.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "920E66C6F4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "You can look at it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "881BABC782",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "I'm going to ask Doug",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3A9E20A26B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "So you have been digitally preserved in about four minutes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3895F564C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "I'd like to thank the wizards here.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "410938BB50",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "We were very lucky to have two of our partners participate in this: the Historic Scotland, and the Glasgow School of Art.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "341C59DCC7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "I'd like to also thank personally the efforts of David Mitchell, who is the Director of Conservation at Historic Scotland.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D560180605",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 6,
        "text": "David.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26BBC635CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "(Applause) And Doug Pritchard, who's the Head of Visualization at the Glasgow School of Art.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F83B010193",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "Let's give them a hand.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D51065AE08",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "(Applause) Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "183F954237",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}